cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Atlantis, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Atlantis: ML-ready archive of satellite-derived flood inundation observations"
abstract: >-
  Atlantis fetches, harmonises and archives flood inundation observations from
  VIIRS (optical), MODIS (optical) and GFM (SAR) on a common 1-arcmin grid,
  accessible via a CLI, a Python API, and a Zarr/STAC archive for machine-learning
  workflows. Developed during ECMWF Code for Earth 2026.
authors:
